      "sourceRationale": "s0078/zh: 伯父蒨，步兵校尉，爲世碩儒。 names He Qian as He Chen's paternal elder uncle only; English idiomatic matches uncle (not father). Blocking label 賀琛之父 never appears. Removing p025 preserves witnessed kinship via p024.",
      "primaryUnits": [
        {
          "unitId": "s0078",
          "zh": "伯父蒨，步兵校尉，爲世碩儒。",
          "literalEn": "His father's elder brother Qian was Commandant of Footsoldiers and a leading scholar of the age.",
          "idiomaticEn": "His uncle Qian, commandant of footsoldiers, was a preeminent scholar of the time."
        },
        {
          "unitId": "s0079",
          "zh": "琛幼，蒨授其經業，一聞便通義理。",
          "literalEn": "When Chen was young, Qian taught him the classics; with one hearing he grasped their meaning.",
          "idiomaticEn": "As a boy Chen studied under Qian; hear a passage once and he understood it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caseId": "sha256:381daba7cf8e9eb43c1188321d715eca681352a2c89c1e63d4df6a0c11e052a7",
      "localPersonId": "liangshu:038:p006",
